<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective April 22.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.28     23.71	  4.16-9.39  4.44-9.68</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.28     23.71	  3.97-8.96  4.25-9.25</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.32     26.32	 12.07	12.07</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.32     26.32	  7.55	 7.55</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.26	  0.39	 0.39</p>
</text>
